  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disability Rights Promotion International (DRPI)  by York University                                Third phase - Disability Rights 3rd ph</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Disability Rights Promotion International (DRPI)  by York University 2009-2012                      Tredje fasen.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disability Rights Promotion International is a project to strengthen  the rigts of disabled persons and facilitatet the implementation of   the CRPD. The project has developed a monitoring tool assessing legal frameworks, individual experiences and media reporting relating to    rights of disabled persons. This is the third phase.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Disablity Rights Promotion International &#xe4;r ett projektet som syftar  till att st&#xe4;rka personer med funktionsnedss&#xe4;ttnings r&#xe4;ttigheter och   underl&#xe4;tta implementering av FN konventionen om r&#xe4;ttigheter f&#xf6;r       personer med funktionsneds&#xe4;ttning. Projektet har utvecklat ett        verktyg som tittar p&#xe5; lagstiftning, inidividens upplevelse och media  rapportering. Detta &#xe4;r tredje fasen.</narrative>
  </description>
